package domain

// Milestone 55: the parsers and the arithmetic of the resources loop, over samples
// captured with STATS_SCRIPT on real systems: an Ubuntu 24.04 VM with Docker
// (codebox: enp6s18, docker0, a br- bridge), and a Debian 12 and an Alpine (BusyBox)
// container with no lxcfs, whose /proc shows the host's figures.

